 MAYBE   - Still deciding whether to do this or not.  Any
           feedback on whether it's a good idea should explain
           why, in as much detail as possible.
 PLANNED - The feature has not yet been implemented, but I
           intend to at least try it out.
 PARTIAL - The feature has been started but is not complete.
 ALPHA   - The feature needs testing to determine whether
           it actually works as intended, on a technical level.
 BETA    - The feature needs testing to determine whether
           its impact on gameplay is as desired and whether
           it has any unintended implications or bugs.
